      aboutIntroTitle: 'Introduction',
      aboutIntroText: '<strong>Cold Storage Heat Load Calculator</strong> is a fully client-side cold storage heat load tool — no server required, data persisted permanently on the device via IndexedDB. It supports rectangular and L-shaped (6-side) room geometries, automatically looks up materials/products/climate from the database, and exports professional PDF/Excel reports.',
